Follow [Hephaestus](hephaestus/Hephaestus.lingua) for mathematics, hard sciences, engineering, computing, and productive infrastructure. Follow [Gaia](gaia/Nature.lingua) for Earth, life, food, and health. Shared productive journeys connect their Records without duplicating them. Questions about reasons, values, and institutions connect to [Philosophy](../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua).

